      ],
      "source": "https://silverhillalabama.com/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Electric lights were installed in Silverhill’s Baptist and Mission churches, supplied by the Robertsdale Electric Station.",
